[{"category":"section","location":"news/#News-for-EOptInterface-Releases","page":"News","text":"","title":"News for EOptInterface Releases"},{"category":"section","location":"news/#[v0.1.1](https://github.com/PSORLab/EOptInterface.jl/releases/tag/v0.1.1)-(April-22,-2026)","page":"News","text":"Added notebook examples.\nRenamed full_solutions to full_solution.\nSeparated tests.\nAdded documentation website.","title":"v0.1.1 (April 22, 2026)"},{"category":"section","location":"news/#[v0.1.0](https://github.com/PSORLab/EOptInterface.jl/releases/tag/v0.1.0)-(Jan-20,-2026)","page":"News","text":"Initial release.","title":"v0.1.0 (Jan 20, 2026)"},{"category":"section","location":"#EOptInterface","page":"API Reference","text":"Documentation for EOptInterface.\n\n","title":"EOptInterface"},{"category":"method","location":"#EOptInterface.decision_vars-Tuple{ModelingToolkit.System}","page":"API Reference","text":"decision_vars(sys)\n\nReturns the decision variables for an optimization problem formulated from a ModelingToolkit system.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"EOptInterface.decision_vars"},{"category":"method","location":"#EOptInterface.full_solution-Tuple{JuMP.Model, ModelingToolkit.System}","page":"API Reference","text":"full_solution(model, sys)\n\nReturns a dictionary of optimal solution values for the observed variables of an algebraic ModelingToolkit system if the JuMP model is solved.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"EOptInterface.full_solution"},{"category":"method","location":"#EOptInterface.register_nlsystem-Tuple{JuMP.Model, ModelingToolkit.System, Symbolics.Num, Vector{Symbolics.Num}}","page":"API Reference","text":"register_nlsystem(model, sys, obj, ineqs)\n\nAutomatically formulates algebraic JuMP constraints and objective function from an algebraic ModelingToolkit system and user-provided constraints and objective symbolic expressions.\n\nArguments\n\nmodel::JuMP.Model: the JuMP model\nsys::ModelingToolkit.System: the ModelingToolkit system\nobj::Symbolics.Num: a symbolic expression of the objective function using the ModelingToolkit system variables\nineqs::Vector{Symbolics.Num}: a vector of symbolic expressions of inequality constraints using the ModelingToolkit system variables\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"EOptInterface.register_nlsystem"},{"category":"method","location":"#EOptInterface.register_odesystem-Tuple{JuMP.Model, ModelingToolkit.System, Tuple{Real, Real}, Real, String}","page":"API Reference","text":"register_odesystem(model, sys, tspan, tstep, integrator)\n\nAutomatically applies forward transcription and registers the discretized ODE ModelingToolkit system as algebraic JuMP constraints.\n\nArguments\n\nmodel::JuMP.Model: the JuMP model\nsys::ModelingToolkit.System: the ModelingToolkit system\ntspan::Tuple{Real,Real}: the time span over which the dynamic model is simulated\ntstep::Real: the time step used in the integration scheme\nintegrator::String: integration scheme used in discretization, \"EE\" for explicit Euler or \"IE\" for implicit Euler\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"EOptInterface.register_odesystem"}]
